msgid ""
"Cannot open last file.\n"
"This could be because it was deleted or because external storage is still "
"being mounted.\n"
"Do you want to retry?"
msgstr ""
"无法打开上次阅读的文件。\n"
"这可能是因为此文件已被删除，或者是外置存储仍在挂载中。\n"
"您想重试吗？"

msgid ""
"Storage is completely read-only. Settings and reading history cannot be "
"saved to disk."
msgstr "存储空间完全只读。设置和阅读历史无法保存到磁盘。"

msgid ""
"Primary storage is read-only. Settings will be saved to temporary storage "
"and may be lost when the device is restarted."
msgstr "主要存储空间为只读。设置将保存到临时存储中，并在设备重启后可能丢失。"

