msgid ""
"Toggle the Hall effect sensor.\n"
"This is used to detect if the cover is closed, which will automatically "
"sleep and wake the device. If there is no cover present the sensor may cause "
"spurious wakeups when located next to a magnetic source."
msgstr ""
"开关霍尔效应传感器。\n"
"此传感器可以检测盖子是否关闭，用于自动睡眠和唤醒设备。如果没有盖上盖子且位于"
"磁源旁边时，可能会导致虚假的唤醒。"

msgid "Night mode"
msgstr "夜间模式"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络设置"

msgid "Screen"
msgstr "屏幕设置"

msgid "Taps and gestures"
msgstr "点击与手势"

msgid "Ignore long-press on corners"
msgstr "忽略边角长按"

msgid "Disable out of order interactions"
msgstr "禁用无序交互"

msgid ""
"Disallow taps or keyboard presses being sent to the UI elements before they "
"are showing up.\n"
"E-ink screens are slow and take noticeable time to update the content. Users "
"may feel laggy, tap the screen or press the keyboard multiple times, and "
"cause the following actions to interact with the unshown UI elements and "
"trigger unexpected actions.\n"
"This feature decides if a user action is expected or caused by the delay of "
"screen refreshing, and drops the unexpected ones.\n"
"It's highly suggested keeping this configuration enabled unless you feel the "
"UI interactions are less responsive."
msgstr ""
"不允许在 UI 元素显示之前向其发送点击或键盘按键。\n"
"电子墨水屏较慢，需要明显的时间来更新内容。用户可能会感到延迟，多次点击屏幕或"
"按键盘，从而导致后续操作与未显示的 UI 元素交互并触发意外操作。\n"
"此功能判定用户操作是预期的还是由于屏幕刷新延迟引起的，并丢弃意外的操作。\n"
"强烈建议保持此配置启用，除非您觉得 UI 交互响应变慢。"

