msgid ""
"Tip:\n"
"Long press on this menu entry to configure HTTP proxy."
msgstr ""
"提示：\n"
"长按此菜单选项可设置 HTTP 代理。"

msgid "Enter proxy address"
msgstr "输入代理地址"

msgid "Disable Wi-Fi connection when inactive"
msgstr "不活跃时禁用Wi-Fi 连接"

msgid ""
"This is unlikely to function properly on a stock Kindle, given how much "
"network activity the framework generates."
msgstr "此功能在原生Kindle上可能不会正常工作，会频繁弹窗。"

msgid ""
"This will automatically turn Wi-Fi off after a generous period of network "
"inactivity, without disrupting workflows that require a network connection, "
"so you can just keep reading without worrying about battery drain."
msgstr ""
"启用后会在无网络活动一段时间后自动关闭 Wi-Fi 用于节省电量，无需等待网络操作完"
"成后再手动关闭 Wi-Fi。"

msgid "Restore Wi-Fi connection on resume"
msgstr "自动重连 Wi-Fi"

msgid ""
"This will attempt to automatically and silently re-connect to Wi-Fi on "
"startup or on resume if Wi-Fi used to be enabled the last time you used "
"KOReader, and you did not explicitly disable it."
msgstr ""
"如果您上次使用 KOReader 时启用了 Wi-Fi，并且没有明确地禁用它，那么这个功能将"
"尝试在启动或恢复时自动且无声地重新连接 Wi-Fi。"

msgid "Network info"
msgstr "网络信息"

msgid "turn on"
msgstr "打开"

msgid "ignore"
msgstr "忽略"

msgid "Action when Wi-Fi is off: %1"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 关闭时的动作：%1"

msgid "Automatically connect to the known Wi-Fi"
msgstr "自动连接到已知 Wi-Fi"

msgid ""
"Instead of showing a list of Wi-Fi SSIDs, KOReader will connect to a known "
"network automatically after turning on Wi-Fi."
msgstr ""
"开启 Wi-Fi 后，KOReader 将自动连接 to 已知网络，而不是显示 Wi-Fi SSID 列表。"

msgid "No available wifi networks found."
msgstr "未找到可用的 Wi-Fi 网络。"

